From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:31:17 -0500
Subject: feat: the peek's card comes in when it opens (issue 91)

A peek over the page fades in over 160 ms, eased out, when it opens, so the
card is on screen while the page paints its first frame (motion O10). It
follows "Animate the sidebar and overlays" and the system's Reduce Motion
(motion O1); off, the card shows as it did. Closing is not animated.

Why: GitHub issue 91. With no motion the card appeared in one frame once
the page had painted, which read as slower than Arc's peek.

Removable when: never; Stedding's own motion.
